==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 1 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Mega Pidgeot ex Drop Event]], which ran from November 18 to 28, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Froakie|51}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*{{m|Bubble}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Froakie}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

